4113,"McDonald's","Fast food restaurant","724 Broadway, New York, NY 10003, United States",40.7291264,-73.9932643,"1,670","2 months ago","Shamrock shake was delicious... always a bit hectic in there but they get the work done","4 stars","Shamrock shake was delicious... always a bit hectic in there but they get the work done",4,"positif",2772,1,1,"cohérent"
4114,"McDonald's","Fast food restaurant","724 Broadway, New York, NY 10003, United States",40.7291264,-73.9932643,"1,670","2 months ago","The Big Mac patty was perfectly dry with no flavor, just right for the drunk folks with taste buds vanished long ago in the weekend festivities. The staff was accommodating and friendly allowing us to use the bathroom. Kindness goes a long way.","3 stars","The Big Mac patty was perfectly dry with no flavor, just right for the drunk folks with taste buds vanished long ago in the weekend festivities. The staff was accommodating and friendly allowing us to use the bathroom. Kindness goes a long way.",3,"neutre",2773,1,1,"cohérent"
4115,"McDonald's","Fast food restaurant","724 Broadway, New York, NY 10003, United States",40.7291264,-73.9932643,"1,670","2 months ago","Terrible restrooms. Average place. If you order from mobile to serve on a table, forget about it... You'll have to go pick it up. I don't mind that, at least inform that the order is ready to pick up, don't leave us hanging! Never coming here anyway. Giving 4 stars for food because its McDonald's, what can go wrong with pre-made food?","1 star","Terrible restrooms. Average place. If you order from mobile to serve on a table, forget about it... You'll have to go pick it up. I don't mind that, at least inform that the order is ready to pick up, don't leave us hanging! Never coming here anyway. Giving 4 stars for food because its McDonald's, what can go wrong with pre-made food?",1,"négatif",2774,1,1,"cohérent"
4116,"McDonald's","Fast food restaurant","724 Broadway, New York, NY 10003, United States",40.7291264,-73.9932643,"1,670","10 months ago","This is a below average McDonald's.  The self-ordering machines don't print receipts with your number so you better catch it on the screen because they may or may not see it on the system.  Fortunately, I was only getting some sodas and they didn't question my order but if it had been a real order it might not have gone smoothly.","2 stars","This is a below average McDonald's. The self-ordering machines don't print receipts with your number so you better catch it on the screen because they may or may not see it on the system. Fortunately, I was only getting some sodas and they didn't question my order but if it had been a real order it might not have gone smoothly.",2,"négatif",2775,1,1,"cohérent"
4117,"McDonald's","Fast food restaurant","724 Broadway, New York, NY 10003, United States",40.7291264,-73.9932643,"1,670","11 months ago","Worst service I had experience in years. Bathroom was closed before 8pm and they did not empathize with me desperately needing to go pee so I had to go to a nearby pizza place to use the restroom. I ordered 2 medium Frappe and they gave me small. I would not recommend anyone because they do not seem to care about providing basic needs to its customers.","1 star","Worst service I had experience in years. Bathroom was closed before 8pm and they did not empathize with me desperately needing to go pee so I had to go to a nearby pizza place to use the restroom. I ordered 2 medium Frappe and they gave me small. I would not recommend anyone because they do not seem to care about providing basic needs to its customers.",1,"négatif",2776,1,1,"cohérent"
4118,"McDonald's","Fast food restaurant","724 Broadway, New York, NY 10003, United States",40.7291264,-73.9932643,"1,670","3 months ago","I placed a mobile order and within 5 minutes of entering the restaurant my order was ready. The food was really fresh and they gave me all the condiments I asked for. Great service!","5 stars","I placed a mobile order and within 5 minutes of entering the restaurant my order was ready. The food was really fresh and they gave me all the condiments I asked for. Great service!",5,"positif",2777,1,1,"cohérent"
4119,"McDonald's","Fast food restaurant","724 Broadway, New York, NY 10003, United States",40.7291264,-73.9932643,"1,670","4 months ago","Probably the cleanest McDonald in the city.  It's partly due to the posted security at the front door to prevent transient homelessness to take over.  Also the competent day and night managers who motivated the food preparation team to perform optimally.  This place should be the exemplary MacDonald store that all the other macDonald stores in the city should learn from.","4 stars","Probably the cleanest McDonald in the city. It's partly due to the posted security at the front door to prevent transient homelessness to take over. Also the competent day and night managers who motivated the food preparation team to perform optimally. This place should be the exemplary MacDonald store that all the other macDonald stores in the city should learn from.",4,"positif",2778,1,1,"cohérent"
4120,"McDonald's","Fast food restaurant","724 Broadway, New York, NY 10003, United States",40.7291264,-73.9932643,"1,670","6 days ago","Very dirty. Served cold drinks warm and without ice and very unorganized.","1 star","Very dirty. Served cold drinks warm and without ice and very unorganized.",1,"négatif",2779,1,1,"cohérent"
4121,"McDonald's","Fast food restaurant","724 Broadway, New York, NY 10003, United States",40.7291264,-73.9932643,"1,670","5 months ago","A friendly and responsive staff delivered (twice after I brought it back) coffee that was not hot. After the second time, I just gave my cup to my daughter whose iced coffee was way too light with cream and diluted. Surprised that McDonalds quality control failed on this visit.","2 stars","A friendly and responsive staff delivered (twice after I brought it back) coffee that was not hot. After the second time, I just gave my cup to my daughter whose iced coffee was way too light with cream and diluted. Surprised that McDonalds quality control failed on this visit.",2,"négatif",2780,1,1,"cohérent"
