13604,"McDonald's","Fast food restaurant","6875 Sand Lake Rd, Orlando, FL 32819, United States",28.4503866,-81.4714142,"19,671","3 years ago","We are in Orlando Florida celebrating my son's 13th birthday so why not check out the world's largest McDonald's.
