13778,"McDonald's","Fast food restaurant","6875 Sand Lake Rd, Orlando, FL 32819, United States",28.4503866,-81.4714142,"19,671","2 months ago","Because it is the largest McDonald, it is a place where you go there so you can scratch off your bucket list.
