13867,"McDonald's","Fast food restaurant","6875 Sand Lake Rd, Orlando, FL 32819, United States",28.4503866,-81.4714142,"19,671","5 months ago","Visited today. Play place was out of service. Dine in service was not available. Some of the menu items we wanted were not available Ordered food from the machine, but a staff member said he couldn't find it in the system, started to retype it in the cashier. Our order was customized and the worker made a few mistakes. When I asked what was going on, he started making rude comments and asked if I spoke English.
