14032,"McDonald's","Fast food restaurant","25200 I-10 Lot 2, San Antonio, TX 78257, United States",29.6762669,-98.6345801,"1,460","2 months ago","The low score is for the Maroon Shirt Manager on 4.3.23 who took the phone off the hook and still allowed the app to sell curbside orders that would never be delivered due to the phone being off the hook. Then, making people sit in the lobby and ignore them while she sat and ""responded to surveys."" Well ma'am  here is one for you, since apparently surveys take president over service.

