15364,"McDonald's","Fast food restaurant","8500 US-290, Austin, TX 78724, United States",30.3291349,-97.6606295,"1,406","3 months ago","This is the best McDonald's I have been to in a long time!   I have 1 across the street from my apartment and I wish I could swap them out.  Service at THIS McDonald's is excellent and everyone that I interacted with was friendly and helpful.  The food actually looked like the advertising and tasted good.  I was so impressed that I asked for the manager so I could thank him and compliment his crew.  I truly believe that managers affect everything about their restaurant,  for  good or bad. Happy, respected employees who feel properly valued always reflect that in their interactions with customers and you could see that this manager was a leader of a team and not just the boss! Great McDonald's experience!","5 stars","This is the best McDonald's I have been to in a long time! I have 1 across the street from my apartment and I wish I could swap them out. Service at THIS McDonald's is excellent and everyone that I interacted with was friendly and helpful. The food actually looked like the advertising and tasted good. I was so impressed that I asked for the manager so I could thank him and compliment his crew. I truly believe that managers affect everything about their restaurant, for good or bad. Happy, respected employees who feel properly valued always reflect that in their interactions with customers and you could see that this manager was a leader of a team and not just the boss! Great McDonald's experience!",5,"positif",12479,1,1,"cohérent"
