15507,"McDonald's","Fast food restaurant","8500 US-290, Austin, TX 78724, United States",30.3291349,-97.6606295,"1,406","3 years ago","I love how on their door they say the drive thru is open till 12am, however between 11:30pm-11:35pm I sat there waiting for someone to respond to me at the speakerbox. I didn't know they had closed their drive thru window early until a customer who was leaving let me know. But I'm not the type to critique without leaving advice so here's some for free.

This is like 300IQ so get ready. You get a piece of paper and write something to the effect of ""drive thru closed"" and tape it to the drive thru speakerbox. This will effectively let everyone except blind drivers know that no one in the store will be taking your order. For blind drivers (and other drivers) you can just use the speakerbox to let them know!","1 star","I love how on their door they say the drive thru is open till 12am, however between 11:30pm-11:35pm I sat there waiting for someone to respond to me at the speakerbox. I didn't know they had closed their drive thru window early until a customer who was leaving let me know. But I'm not the type to critique without leaving advice so here's some for free. This is like 300IQ so get ready. You get a piece of paper and write something to the effect of ""drive thru closed"" and tape it to the drive thru speakerbox. This will effectively let everyone except blind drivers know that no one in the store will be taking your order. For blind drivers (and other drivers) you can just use the speakerbox to let them know!",1,"négatif",12622,1,1,"cohérent"
