17249,"McDonald's","Fast food restaurant","702-2 Haddonfield-Berlin Rd, Voorhees Township, NJ 08043, United States",39.8520594,-74.9810994,"933","9 months ago","The absolute worst McDonald's I've ever dealt with. The most incompetent management I've ever experienced.
