usted and appalled by their lack attentiveness of the food they are distributing to the point I ask another customer next to me if he had seen what I did.... I didn't want to feel as if I was picking but he agreed, he saw pink, so I finally asked for a refund and fresh fries and left. I will not support this mcdonald's again! IDK how to post pics, I don't see where I may be able to attach.",1,"négatif",14781,2,1,"cohérent"
