19293,"McDonald's","Fast food restaurant","621 Broadway, Newark, NJ 07104, United States",40.7719101,-74.1614754,"1,564","6 years ago","This McDonald's has always been bottom-of-the-barrel as far back as I can remember, and a sleek face-lift doesn't change the fact that a visit to this McDonald's will leave you with a bad taste in your mouth. The list of their offenses is too long to detail every one, so I'll compile a list:
