26742,"McDonald's","Fast food restaurant","10901 Riverside Dr, North Hollywood, CA 91602, United States",34.1525074,-118.3679036,"1,794","5 years ago","The drive through at this McDonald's has always been busy every time I've gone.  It's honestly worth driving a little extra to another location if you are in a hurry.  I've been stuck in the drive thru line for over 15 minutes on several occasions just ordering a single cheeseburger.  Granted, compared to In and Out that's nothing, but this is McDonalds.  That aside, the interior has always been pretty clean when I've went inside.  If you go for breakfast on the weekends, once again, be prepared to wait.  They do take Apple Pay and Android pay!  The one time I used it, the person behind the counter actually knew what it was.  So many places tell you they don't have it but just don't know what it is.  Another big plus is the drive through is 24 hours.","2 stars","The drive through at this McDonald's has always been busy every time I've gone. It's honestly worth driving a little extra to another location if you are in a hurry. I've been stuck in the drive thru line for over 15 minutes on several occasions just ordering a single cheeseburger. Granted, compared to In and Out that's nothing, but this is McDonalds. That aside, the interior has always been pretty clean when I've went inside. If you go for breakfast on the weekends, once again, be prepared to wait. They do take Apple Pay and Android pay! The one time I used it, the person behind the counter actually knew what it was. So many places tell you they don't have it but just don't know what it is. Another big plus is the drive through is 24 hours.",2,"négatif",13296,2,1,"cohérent"
