27360,"McDonald's","Fast food restaurant","1100 N US Hwy 377, Roanoke, TX 76262, United States",33.0093179,-97.2229254,"999","4 months ago","Yesterday (2/3/2023), I stopped at Roanoke McDonald's to get breakfast.  I ordered the Big Breakfast with pancakes via kiosk.  My order was number 797, upon serving me my food I ask for an extra syrup.  The employee gave me the syrup but was very rude in telling me it cost .35 cents and next time include it in my order.  Without giving me a chance to explain he walked off.   To add to the bad service I discovered after leaving, my pancakes were cold.  I don't usually go to this McDonald's, and usually don't get bad service at McDonald's but figured I'd take the time to let others know how this McDonald's is treating it's customers!","1 star","Yesterday (2/3/2023), I stopped at Roanoke McDonald's to get breakfast. I ordered the Big Breakfast with pancakes via kiosk. My order was number 797, upon serving me my food I ask for an extra syrup. The employee gave me the syrup but was very rude in telling me it cost .35 cents and next time include it in my order. Without giving me a chance to explain he walked off. To add to the bad service I discovered after leaving, my pancakes were cold. I don't usually go to this McDonald's, and usually don't get bad service at McDonald's but figured I'd take the time to let others know how this McDonald's is treating it's customers!",1,"négatif",14283,2,1,"cohérent"
