27440,"McDonald's","Fast food restaurant","1100 N US Hwy 377, Roanoke, TX 76262, United States",33.0093179,-97.2229254,"999","10 years ago","This McDonalds sucks. They recently had a remodel which means the inside is nice and they have the fancy double drive-thru, but unfortunately the remodel could not fix the main issue with this McDonalds: The management.

